# Domain Layer Rules (Critical)

The cube domain is **pure logic**.

## Forbidden imports

Do not import:

- React
- Three.js
- Zustand
- Any UI libraries
- DOM APIs (`document`, `window`, `localStorage`, etc.)

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — couples domain to UI/rendering
import { useState } from 'react'
import * as THREE from 'three'
import { create } from 'zustand'

// ✅ GOOD — domain-only types and pure functions
import type { CubeState, Move } from './types'
import { applyMove } from './moves'
```

## Allowed

- TypeScript only
- Pure functions
- Data structures
- Deterministic logic

## Constraints

- No side effects
- No rendering logic
- No state management libraries
- No dependency on application or UI layers

## Responsibilities

- Cube state representation
- Move execution
- Validation
- Scrambling
- Serialization
